            'anime-accent':'lowres, blurry, rough sketch, unfinished, flat dull colors, muddy shading, bad lighting, photorealistic live-action photo, western comic style, chibi, super deformed, childish proportions, oversized cartoon eyes, doll face, plastic skin, cheap 3d render, flat clipart, crude lineart, poorly drawn eyes, fused hair, broken highlights',
            'anime-cel':'photorealistic live-action photo, western comic style, chibi, super deformed, childish proportions, plastic skin, muddy lineart, uncontrolled painterly smears, cheap 3d render',
            'anime-cinematic':'photorealistic live-action photo, western comic style, chibi, super deformed, childish proportions, plastic skin, flat clipart, empty background, cheap 3d render',
